OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity asks staff to review
OL,4,Asome partnerships with China after MI5
OL,5,Awarning
OL,6,
OL,7,FQueen's University of Belfast (QUB) has
OL,8,Fasked staff to review some partnerships
OL,9,Fwith China after a warning from MI5.
OL,11,FIn a highly unusual move, the UK's
OL,12,Finternal security service had warned
OL,13,Funiversities they may have
OL,14,Funintentionally assisted China's
OL,15,Fespionage.
OL,17,FMI5 said the China General Technology
OL,18,FResearch Institute (CGTRI) was a front
OL,19,Fcompany working for China's
OL,20,Fintelligence and security service.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
